   - **Recipients**: `admin@example.com`
   - **Subject**: `Error Logs Detected`
   - **Body**: `More than 5 error logs detected in the last 5 minutes.`

### Summary

By following these steps, you can set up alerts in Kibana to monitor specific log patterns and trigger actions when certain conditions are met. This helps you proactively manage and respond to issues in your log data. If you have specific requirements or need more detailed guidance, feel free to ask!

